1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,300
Everybody serves
a master.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,200
Most people never
find out who theirs is —

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,800
until money asks
them to choose.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,900
Money is a
great servant.

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,400
And a terrible god.

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,700
The first question
was never "How much?"

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,600
It's — "Whose is it?"

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,600
So there's a code.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,300
OWNERSHIP.

10
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,800
FAITHFULNESS.

11
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,000
MASTERY.

12
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,100
MULTIPLICATION.

13
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:33,300
Be faithful
in the little.

14
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,900
Don't bury what He
put in your hands.

15
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,600
Christ my Master.
Money my servant.

16
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,000
26 episodes.
All of August.

17
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,900
Crack the code.
